# Bundled engine assets (filled in by CI before the Android build)
#
# The GitHub Actions workflow:
#   1. compiles  ../src/AB-JChess  (arm64) into  ./AB-JChess
#   2. downloads abjchess-20260911.nnue and copies it here as  ./abjchess-20260911.nnue
#
# These two files are embedded into the Rust lib via include_bytes! (Android
# only, see src-tauri/src/lib.rs) and shipped inside the final APK, so end
# users do not need to add or load an engine manually.